trait-background-vampire-name = Lesser Vampire
trait-background-vampire-description =
    You are infected with an ancient virus, forcing you to consume blood for sustenance.
    Comes with various subtraits you can pick at roundstart, both negative and positive.

trait-background-armorer-name = Armorer
trait-background-armorer-description =
    Whether a former mercenary, soldier, officer or just an enthusiast,
    you have intricate knowledge of firearms and how they work.
    You can use your knowledge to make improvised guns and ammo.

trait-background-firearms-expert-name = Firearms Expert
trait-background-firearms-expert-description =
    More intricate knowledge on firearms, their functions, and how 
    You can use your knowledge to forge advanced guns and ammo with surplus materials.

trait-background-jury-rigger-name = Jury Rigger
trait-background-jury-rigger-description =
    Ever since you were a youngin, you've had a knack for tinkering with electronics.
    You're able to throw together simple parts with ease.

trait-background-electrical-engineer-name = Electrical Engineer
trait-background-electrical-engineer-description =
    You've had a lot of experience working with electronics.
    You're able to throw together intricate electronics with ease.
